&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://brickset.com/article/136018/lego-ideas-backlog"&gt;Continue reading »&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;copy; 2026 &lt;a href='https://brickset.com/'&gt;Brickset.com&lt;/a&gt;. Republication prohibited without prior permission.&lt;em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 10 Nov 2026 08:00:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>Random set of the day: X-wing Starfighter &amp; Yavin 4</title><link>https://brickset.com/article/136033</link><author>Huwbot</author><guid>https://brickset.com/article/136033</guid><description>&lt;img style='float:left; margin: 0 10px 10px 0; max-width: 240px; max-height: 240px;' src='https://images.brickset.com/sets/small/9677-1.jpg' alt="Random set of the day: X-wing Starfighter &amp; Yavin 4"/&gt;&lt;p&gt;Today's random set is &lt;a href='/sets/9677-1'&gt;9677&lt;/a&gt; X-wing Starfighter &amp; Yavin 4, released during 2012. It's one of &lt;a href='/sets/theme-Star-Wars/year-2012'&gt;38 Star Wars sets&lt;/a&gt; produced that year. It contains &lt;a href='/inventories/9677-1'&gt;77 pieces&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href='/minifigs/in-9677-1'&gt;1 minifig&lt;/a&gt;, and its retail price was US$9.99 / £9.99, which equates to about US$14 / £14 in today's money.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;It's owned by 11,962 Brickset members. If you want to add it to your collection you should find it for sale at &lt;a href='https://www.brickowl.com/search/catalog?query=9677-1&amp;jump=1&amp;cat=3&amp;utm_source=brickset'&gt;Brick Owl&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href='https://www.bricklink.com/v2/catalog/catalogitem.page?S=9677-1#T=S'&gt;BrickLink&lt;/a&gt;, where new ones sell for around $22.50,  or &lt;a href='/buy/ebay/?query=9677-1'&gt;eBay&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://brickset.com/article/136033/random-set-of-the-day-x-wing-starfighter-yavin-4"&gt;Continue reading »&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;copy; 2026 &lt;a href='https://brickset.com/'&gt;Brickset.com&lt;/a&gt;. Republication prohibited without prior permission.&lt;em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 10 Nov 2026 03:01:02 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>LEGO Super Mario Yoshi set teased</title><link>https://brickset.com/article/136026</link><author>Huw</author><guid>https://brickset.com/article/136026</guid><description>&lt;img style='float:left; margin: 0 10px 10px 0; max-width: 240px; max-height: 240px;' src='https://images.brickset.com/news/thumbs/large/136026_55642477918_4e694d6fab_c.jpg' alt="LEGO Super Mario Yoshi set teased"/&gt;&lt;p&gt;Eagle-eyed Adam over at &lt;a href="https://bricksfanz.com/new-lego-super-mario-yoshi-set-teased/"&gt;BricksFanz&lt;/a&gt; spotted this teaser for a large-scale model of Yoshi in the Nintendo Today app this morning.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;It&amp;#39;ll join Mario, Luigi, Bowser and the Piranha Plant in the range of brick-built Super Mario characters that have been released so far. We anticipate that it&amp;#39;ll be available early in the New Year.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;copy; 2026 &lt;a href='https://brickset.com/'&gt;Brickset.com&lt;/a&gt;. Republication prohibited without prior permission.&lt;em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 09 Nov 2026 21:00:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>BrickLink downtime continues</title><link>https://brickset.com/article/136025</link><author>Huw</author><guid>https://brickset.com/article/136025</guid><description>&lt;img style='float:left; margin: 0 10px 10px 0; max-width: 240px; max-height: 240px;' src='https://images.brickset.com/news/thumbs/large/136025_maintenance_parrot.jpg' alt="BrickLink downtime continues"/&gt;&lt;p&gt;As you may have noticed, BrickLink has been down since late last week, and it&amp;#39;s just been announced that it will remain offline until at least Wednesday evening.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;That impacts us here because we hot link to minifigure images on the BrickLink server, which is why our listings are not currently showing them, and we also uses its API to gather prices and availability of sets, parts, and minifigs.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;No announcement, or indeed any communication at all, has been made about why it&amp;#39;s been offline for so long, so we will have to draw our own conclusions. I guess it&amp;#39;s possible that the recent well publicised PHP issues have something to do with it.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;In the meantime, the independent LEGO marketplace &lt;a href="https://brickowl.com?utm_source=brickset"&gt;BrickOwl&lt;/a&gt; remains online and ready to sate your ABS cravings.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Are you a buyer or a seller affected by the outage? What do you make of it?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;copy; 2026 &lt;a href='https://brickset.com/'&gt;Brickset.com&lt;/a&gt;. Republication prohibited without prior permission.&lt;em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 09 Nov 2026 18:17:29 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>Competition: Build a Restaurant of the World</title><link>https://brickset.com/article/136015</link><author>Huw</author><guid>https://brickset.com/article/136015</guid><description>&lt;img style='float:left; margin: 0 10px 10px 0; max-width: 240px; max-height: 240px;' src='https://images.brickset.com/news/thumbs/large/136015_row.jpg' alt="Competition: Build a Restaurant of the World"/&gt;&lt;p&gt;It&amp;#39;s been five years since we last held a building competition, so it&amp;#39;s high time we arranged another one!&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;The &lt;a href="https://brickset.com/sets/subtheme-Restaurants-of-the-World/theme-Promotional"&gt;four Restaurants of the World&lt;/a&gt; that were offered as gifts with purchase during the year were great fun and well received. We want you to build one in the same style. Simple as that.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Your model should:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Be built on a 10x12 stud base&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Have a single-storey building that&amp;#39;s 8x10 in size&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Be open at the back&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Have an oversized representation of the food that&amp;#39;s being sold on the roof&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Optionally include a minifig&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Not use AI to enhance its appearance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

&lt;p&gt;You could make a seaside fish and chip shop, an ice cream parlour, coffee booth, or perhaps something that&amp;#39;s common in your country: it&amp;#39;s entirely up to you!&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;We encourage you to build with real bricks, but digital entries will be accepted, as long as they could be built in real life. Feel free to add &amp;#39;stickers&amp;#39; for the sign/menu etc.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Entries will be judged on their originality, how well they capture the essence of the location and/or the food they are selling, use of the space and, of course, the design of the rooftop appendage.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Three prizes will be awarded, with the grand prize being &lt;a href="https://brickset.com/sets/11387-1"&gt;11387&lt;/a&gt; Holiday House. Second and third prizes will be announced later.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;To enter, add a couple of photos of your entry to the group on &lt;a href="https://www.flickr.com/groups/14895961@N25/pool/"&gt;Flickr&lt;/a&gt;, upload to Instagram with the hashtag #bricksetrowcompetition, or email your entry to competition@brickset.com by Monday, 30th November.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Good luck!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;copy; 2026 &lt;a href='https://brickset.com/'&gt;Brickset.com&lt;/a&gt;. Republication prohibited without prior permission.&lt;em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 09 Nov 2026 15:00:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>First 2026 Ideas review period results announced</title><link>https://brickset.com/article/136017</link><author>Huw</author><guid>https://brickset.com/article/136017</guid><description>&lt;img style='float:left; margin: 0 10px 10px 0; max-width: 240px; max-height: 240px;' src='https://images.brickset.com/news/thumbs/large/131817_ideas2026.jpg' alt="First 2026 Ideas review period results announced"/&gt;&lt;p&gt;The results of the first 2026 review period have been announced.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Three projects from the 97 were successful, and two have been added to the parking lot, pending a decision.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Find out which ones prevailed after the break.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://brickset.com/article/136017/first-2026-ideas-review-period-results-announced"&gt;Continue reading »&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;copy; 2026 &lt;a href='https://brickset.com/'&gt;Brickset.com&lt;/a&gt;. Republication prohibited without prior permission.&lt;em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 09 Nov 2026 13:00:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>Old GWPs return to LEGO.com</title><link>https://brickset.com/article/136011</link><author>Huw</author><guid>https://brickset.com/article/136011</guid><description>&lt;img style='float:left; margin: 0 10px 10px 0; max-width: 240px; max-height: 240px;' src='https://images.brickset.com/sets/small/40906-1.jpg' alt="Old GWPs return to LEGO.com"/&gt;&lt;p&gt;While we await the availability of new GWPs at LEGO.com later in the month, several that were available earlier in the year have returned:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;In the UK and Europe:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="https://brickset.com/sets/40906-1"&gt;40906&lt;/a&gt; Restaurants of the World: Japan free with purchases over &amp;pound;160 / $180 until the 15th of November&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

&lt;p&gt;in the USA:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="https://brickset.com/sets/40886-1"&gt;40886&lt;/a&gt; Penguins in Love free when you spend over $100 / CA$130 before the 15th November&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

&lt;p&gt;In Australia:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="https://brickset.com/sets/40768-1"&gt;40768&lt;/a&gt; Star Trek: Type-15 Shuttlepod free when you buy &lt;a href="https://brickset.com/sets/10356-1"&gt;10356&lt;/a&gt; Star Trek: U.S.S. Enterprise NCC-1701-D until the 20th November&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

&lt;p&gt;In New Zealand:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="https://brickset.com/sets/40908-1"&gt;40908&lt;/a&gt; Restaurants of the World: Greece free when you spend over &amp;pound;320 until 15th November&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="https://brickset.com/sets/40768-1"&gt;40768&lt;/a&gt; Star Trek: Type-15 Shuttlepod free when you buy &lt;a href="https://brickset.com/sets/10356-1"&gt;10356&lt;/a&gt; Star Trek: U.S.S. Enterprise NCC-1701-D until the 20th November&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Additionally, everywhere:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="https://brickset.com/sets/30720-1"&gt;30720&lt;/a&gt; Ariel &amp;amp; Flounder&amp;#39;s Birthday Music Fun free when spending over &amp;pound;35 / &amp;euro;40 / &amp;pound;40 on Disney sets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="/click?r=1109"&gt;Shop now &amp;raquo;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;copy; 2026 &lt;a href='https://brickset.com/'&gt;Brickset.com&lt;/a&gt;. Republication prohibited without prior permission.&lt;em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 09 Nov 2026 09:10:32 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>Random set of the day: TIE Advanced Prototype</title><link>https://brickset.com/article/136009</link><author>Huwbot</author><guid>https://brickset.com/article/136009</guid><description>&lt;img style='float:left; margin: 0 10px 10px 0; max-width: 240px; max-height: 240px;' src='https://images.brickset.com/sets/small/30275-1.jpg' alt="Random set of the day: TIE Advanced Prototype"/&gt;&lt;p&gt;Today's random set is &lt;a href='/sets/30275-1'&gt;30275&lt;/a&gt; TIE Advanced Prototype, released during 2015. It's one of &lt;a href='/sets/theme-Star-Wars/year-2015'&gt;70 Star Wars sets&lt;/a&gt; produced that year. It contains &lt;a href='/inventories/30275-1'&gt;47 pieces&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;It's owned by 6,507 Brickset members. If you want to add it to your collection you should find it for sale at &lt;a href='https://www.brickowl.com/search/catalog?query=30275-1&amp;jump=1&amp;cat=3&amp;utm_source=brickset'&gt;Brick Owl&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href='https://www.bricklink.com/v2/catalog/catalogitem.page?S=30275-1#T=S'&gt;BrickLink&lt;/a&gt;, where new ones sell for around $5.90,  or &lt;a href='/buy/ebay/?query=30275-1'&gt;eBay&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://brickset.com/article/136009/random-set-of-the-day-tie-advanced-prototype"&gt;Continue reading »&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;copy; 2026 &lt;a href='https://brickset.com/'&gt;Brickset.com&lt;/a&gt;. Republication prohibited without prior permission.&lt;em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 09 Nov 2026 03:01:02 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>Recent reviews</title><link>https://brickset.com/article/136008</link><author>Huwbot</author><guid>https://brickset.com/article/136008</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;These are the reviews that we've published recently:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;table class='reviewlist'&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class='col1'&gt;&lt;img src='https://images.brickset.com/sets/small/72161-1.jpg' /&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;a href='https://brickset.com/article/133777'&gt;72161 Drone Search for Mythical Mew&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;Discover a rare Pokémon behind a clever little game&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class='col1'&gt;&lt;img src='https://images.brickset.com/sets/small/75642-1.jpg' /&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;a href='https://brickset.com/article/135711'&gt;75642 Showdown with Captain Smoker&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;There is little included for such a high price, but the minifigures in particular are superb&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class='col1'&gt;&lt;img src='https://images.brickset.com/sets/small/40874-1.jpg' /&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;a href='https://brickset.com/article/135696'&gt;40874 Santa's Holiday Countdown&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;A well-built Santa and chimney diorama, with a somewhat pointless countdown feature.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class='col1'&gt;&lt;img src='https://images.brickset.com/sets/small/42705-1.jpg' /&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;a href='https://brickset.com/article/135584'&gt;42705 Cosy Autumn Forest Cabin&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;A larger autumnal scene with fun moving functions &lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class='col1'&gt;&lt;img src='https://images.brickset.com/sets/small/40898-1.jpg' /&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;a href='https://brickset.com/article/135718'&gt;40898 Venetian Water Taxi&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;A nice addition to the Venetian scene but not an essential one&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class='col1'&gt;&lt;img src='https://images.brickset.com/sets/small/11388-1.jpg' /&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;a href='https://brickset.com/article/135635'&gt;11388 Venetian Neighbourhood&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;A sizeable and detailed model but its overall appearance is let down by some questionable architectural choices&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href='https://brickset.com/news/category-Set-review'&gt;View more reviews in the news archive »&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;copy; 2026 &lt;a href='https://brickset.com/'&gt;Brickset.com&lt;/a&gt;. Republication prohibited without prior permission.&lt;em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 08 Nov 2026 23:01:02 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>This week's top news articles</title><link>https://brickset.com/article/135996</link><author>Huwbot</author><guid>https://brickset.com/article/135996</guid><description>&lt;img style='float:left; margin: 0 10px 10px 0; max-width: 240px; max-height: 240px;' src='https://brickset.com/assets/images/logo/logo.png' alt="This week's top news articles"/&gt;&lt;p&gt;These are the most read articles that we've posted during the last fortnight:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;table class='neattable'&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;th&gt;Article&lt;/th&gt;&lt;th&gt;Date&lt;/th&gt;&lt;th&gt;Views&lt;/th&gt;&lt;th&gt;Likes&lt;/th&gt;&lt;th&gt;Comments&lt;/th&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;a href='https://brickset.com/article/135635/review-11388-venetian-neighbourhood'&gt;Review: 11388 Venetian Neighbourhood&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;25 Oct&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;12706&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;178&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;88&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;a href='https://brickset.com/article/135900/21375-godzilla-the-biggest-ever-lego-ideas-set-revealed!'&gt;21375 Godzilla, the biggest ever LEGO Ideas set, revealed!&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;03 Nov&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;12490&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;103&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;190&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;a href='https://brickset.com/article/135732/lego-marvel-what-if--sanctum-sanctorum-revealed!'&gt;LEGO Marvel What If...? Sanctum Sanctorum revealed!&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;28 Oct&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;10898&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;99&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;80&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;a href='https://brickset.com/article/135941/first-images-of-2027-lego-botanicals-sets!'&gt;First images of 2027 LEGO Botanicals sets!&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;06 Nov&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;9155&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;129&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;39&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;a href='https://brickset.com/article/135844/technic-42254-solar-system-planets-in-orbit-official-images!'&gt;Technic 42254 Solar System Planets in Orbit official images!&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;01 Nov&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;7412&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;122&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;78&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;a href='https://brickset.com/article/135947/lego-ninjago-71888-ivo-s-ninja-dojo-revealed!'&gt;LEGO NINJAGO 71888 Ivo's Ninja Dojo revealed!&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;06 Nov&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;7359&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;127&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;74&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;a href='https://brickset.com/article/135699/11388-venetian-neighbourhood-minifigures'&gt;11388 Venetian Neighbourhood minifigures&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;26 Oct&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;7222&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;116&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;43&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;a href='https://brickset.com/article/135953/2027-chinese-festival-sets-revealed'&gt;2027 Chinese Festival sets revealed&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;06 Nov&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;6669&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;110&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;34&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;a href='https://brickset.com/article/135733/three-2027-lego-friends-sets-announced!'&gt;Three 2027 LEGO Friends sets announced!&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;28 Oct&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;6452&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;78&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;56&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;a href='https://brickset.com/article/135963/six-more-botanical-sets-for-2027-revealed!'&gt;Six more Botanical sets for 2027 revealed!&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;06 Nov&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;5937&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;111&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;41&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;&lt;p&gt;The total number of news article views this week is 155,867, which is 23,219 more than last week.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;copy; 2026 &lt;a href='https://brickset.com/'&gt;Brickset.com&lt;/a&gt;. Republication prohibited without prior permission.&lt;em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 08 Nov 2026 10:01:02 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>Random set of the day: Hydraxon</title><link>https://brickset.com/article/135993</link><author>Huwbot</author><guid>https://brickset.com/article/135993</guid><description>&lt;img style='float:left; margin: 0 10px 10px 0; max-width: 240px; max-height: 240px;' src='https://images.brickset.com/sets/small/8923-1.jpg' alt="Random set of the day: Hydraxon"/&gt;&lt;p&gt;Today's random set is &lt;a href='/sets/8923-1'&gt;8923&lt;/a&gt; Hydraxon, released during 2007. It's one of &lt;a href='/sets/theme-Bionicle/year-2007'&gt;31 Bionicle sets&lt;/a&gt; produced that year. It contains &lt;a href='/inventories/8923-1'&gt;165 pieces&lt;/a&gt;, and its retail price was US$19.99 / £14.99, which equates to about US$30 / £24 in today's money.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;It's owned by 1,815 Brickset members. If you want to add it to your collection you should find it for sale at &lt;a href='https://www.brickowl.com/search/catalog?query=8923-1&amp;jump=1&amp;cat=3&amp;utm_source=brickset'&gt;Brick Owl&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href='https://www.bricklink.com/v2/catalog/catalogitem.page?S=8923-1#T=S'&gt;BrickLink&lt;/a&gt;, where new ones sell for around $382.60,  or &lt;a href='/buy/ebay/?query=8923-1'&gt;eBay&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://brickset.com/article/135993/random-set-of-the-day-hydraxon"&gt;Continue reading »&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;copy; 2026 &lt;a href='https://brickset.com/'&gt;Brickset.com&lt;/a&gt;. Republication prohibited without prior permission.&lt;em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 08 Nov 2026 03:01:02 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>Random figure of the day: twn290</title><link>https://brickset.com/article/135992</link><author>Huwbot</author><guid>https://brickset.com/article/135992</guid><description>&lt;img style='float:left; margin: 0 10px 10px 0; max-width: 240px; max-height: 240px;' src='https://img.bricklink.com/ItemImage/MN/0/twn290.png' alt="Random figure of the day: twn290"/&gt;&lt;p&gt;Today's random figure is &lt;a href='/minifigs/twn290'&gt;twn290&lt;/a&gt; &lt;em&gt;Mom, Medium Lavender Jacket over Lavender Shirt, Dark Tan Legs, Black Hair&lt;/em&gt;, a &lt;a href='/minifigs/category-Town'&gt;Town&lt;/a&gt; figure that came in one set, &lt;a href='/sets/10257-1'&gt;10257&lt;/a&gt; Carousel, released during 2017.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Our members collectively own a total of 41,065 of them. If you'd like to buy one you should find it for sale at &lt;a href='https://www.brickowl.com/search/catalog?query=twn290&amp;jump=1&amp;&amp;utm_source=brickset'&gt;Brick Owl&lt;/a&gt; or &lt;a href='https://www.bricklink.com/v2/search.page?q=twn290'&gt;BrickLink&lt;/a&gt;, where new ones sell for around $5.40.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://brickset.com/article/135992/random-figure-of-the-day-twn290"&gt;Continue reading »&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;copy; 2026 &lt;a href='https://brickset.com/'&gt;Brickset.com&lt;/a&gt;. Republication prohibited without prior permission.&lt;em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 08 Nov 2026 02:01:03 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>What's hot this week</title><link>https://brickset.com/article/135991</link><author>Huwbot</author><guid>https://brickset.com/article/135991</guid><description>&lt;img style='float:left; margin: 0 10px 10px 0; max-width: 240px; max-height: 240px;' src='https://brickset.com/assets/images/logo/logo.png' alt="What's hot this week"/&gt;&lt;p&gt;These are the sets that have been viewed the most this week:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;table class='neattable'&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;th class='textcenter'&gt;TW&lt;/th&gt;&lt;th class='textcenter'&gt;LW&lt;/th&gt;&lt;th&gt;&lt;/th&gt;&lt;th&gt;Set&lt;/th&gt;&lt;th&gt;Views&lt;/th&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class='textcenter'&gt;&lt;strong&gt;1&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td class='textcenter'&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td class='textcenter'&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;a href='/sets/40865-1/Buddy-the-Elf'&gt;40865&lt;/a&gt; Buddy the Elf&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;4673&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class='textcenter'&gt;&lt;strong&gt;2&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td class='textcenter'&gt;1&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td class='textcenter'&gt;&amp;darr;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;a href='/sets/40889-1/Build-Paint-and-Play!'&gt;40889&lt;/a&gt; Build, Paint and Play!&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;3047&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class='textcenter'&gt;&lt;strong&gt;3&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td class='textcenter'&gt;20&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td class='textcenter'&gt;&amp;uarr;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;a href='/sets/40898-1/Venetian-Water-Taxi'&gt;40898&lt;/a&gt; Venetian Water Taxi&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;2739&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class='textcenter'&gt;&lt;strong&gt;4&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td class='textcenter'&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td class='textcenter'&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;a href='/sets/42254-1/Solar-System-Planets-in-Orbit'&gt;42254&lt;/a&gt; Solar System Planets in Orbit&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;2504&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class='textcenter'&gt;&lt;strong&gt;5&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td class='textcenter'&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td class='textcenter'&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;a href='/sets/21375-1/Godzilla'&gt;21375&lt;/a&gt; Godzilla&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;2255&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class='textcenter'&gt;&lt;strong&gt;6&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td class='textcenter'&gt;5&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td class='textcenter'&gt;&amp;darr;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;a href='/sets/75192-1/Millennium-Falcon'&gt;75192&lt;/a&gt; Millennium Falcon&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;2109&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class='textcenter'&gt;&lt;strong&gt;7&lt;/strong